              <span class="cs-subsection-subheading uppercase">
                <span class="en">Decision 03</span>
                <span class="fr">Décision 03</span>
              </span>
              <h3 class="cs-subsection-heading">
                <span class="en">Search that looks inside datasets</span>
                <span class="fr">Une recherche qui lit le contenu</span>
