                    <span class="en"
                      >Most filters that use technical terms now come with a
                      short explanation.</span
                    >
                    <span class="fr"
                      >La plupart des filtres aux termes techniques sont
                      désormais accompagnés d'une courte phrase explicative.</span
                    >
                  </p>
